## Dissolution Roadmap — Gates → GAIA

The goal: all gate identities dissolve into ONE — **gaia@GAIA** / **GAIA@home**
- Phase 0: Gates as named nodes (CURRENT)
- Phase 1: grapheneGate → biomeOS on Pixel
- Phase 2: All nodes run biomeOS layer
- Phase 3: Identity collapses — not gates, just GAIA
- Phase 4: GAIA@home — location-aware, hardware-transparent

